1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
We just witnessed the most unbelievable, picture-perfect launch that I could ever imagine.

2
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:11,180
And in a way, even though it's been so many years,

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,380
I never quite wrapped my head around the idea that someday this would happen.

4
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:23,600
And watching Roman ascend into the sky was unlike anything I could explain or describe.

5
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:29,820
Because I could never convince myself that it was actually real.

6
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:34,500
That we would manifest this amazing machine and get it into space.

7
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:38,400
But we did. And now it's there for everybody.

